# Alhaitham Xingqiu Fischl Dori. ~22s Rot. Long field time Alhaitham with Dori supplying enough energy to Alhaitham to avoid additional ER investment. Deploys Oz during Alhaitham's burst window. 50% Quicken uptime; Alhaitham combo focuses on driving rainswords.

# Team
alhaitham char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
alhaitham add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
#alhaitham add weapon="wolffang" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
alhaitham add set="gd" count=4;
alhaitham add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 dendro%=0.466 cr=0.311; #main
alhaitham add stats def%=0.062*2 def=19.68*2 hp=253.94*2 hp%=0.0496*2 atk=16.54*2 atk%=0.0496*2 er=0.0551*3 em=19.82*3 cr=0.0331*10 cd=0.0662*12;
#alhaitham add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 dendro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
#alhaitham add stats def%=0.062*2 def=19.68*2 hp=253.94*2 hp%=0.0496*2 atk=16.54*2 atk%=0.0496*2 er=0.0551*3 em=19.82*6 cr=0.0331*12 cd=0.0662*7; # WF

xingqiu char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
xingqiu add weapon="favsword" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
xingqiu add set="deepwood" count=4;
xingqiu add stats hp=4780 atk=311 atk%=0.466 hydro%=0.466 cr=0.311; #main
xingqiu add stats def%=0.062*2 def=19.68*2 hp=253.94*2 hp%=0.0496*2 atk=16.54*2 atk%=0.0496*2 er=0.0551*8 em=19.82*2 cr=0.0331*10 cd=0.0662*8;

fischl char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
fischl add weapon="stringless" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
fischl add set="gt" count=4;
fischl add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 electro%=0.466 cr=0.311; #main
fischl add stats def%=0.062*2 def=19.68*2 hp=253.94*2 hp%=0.0496*2 atk=16.54*2 atk%=0.0496*2 er=0.0551*2 em=19.82*6 cr=0.0331*8 cd=0.0662*12;

dori char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
dori add weapon="flameforgedinsight" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
dori add set="fopl" count=4;
dori add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 em=187 em=187; #main
dori add stats def%=0.062*2 def=19.68*2 hp=253.94*2 hp%=0.0496*2 atk=16.54*2 atk%=0.0496*2 er=0.0551*5 em=19.82*6 cr=0.0331*12 cd=0.0662*5;

# Options
options iteration=1000;
options swap_delay=12;
energy every interval=480,720 amount=1;

# Targets
target lvl=100 resist=0.1 radius=2 pos=0,2.4 hp=100000000;
#target lvl=100 resist=0.1 radius=2 pos=3.4,0 hp=100000000;

# Rotation
active fischl;
fischl skill; # small increase

#active xq;

for let r=0; r<4; r=r+1 {
  xingqiu skill, dash;
  while !.xingqiu.burst.ready {
    xingqiu attack;
  }
  xingqiu burst, attack;

  dori skill, attack, burst; # No N1 after burst for better Quicken uptime

  haitham burst;

  amy attack;
  if .amy.skill.ready {
    amy skill;
  } else {
    amy attack, burst;
  }

  haitham attack:3, dash,
          attack:3, skill,
          attack:3, charge, dash,
          attack:3, dash,
          attack:3, dash,
          attack:3, dash,
          attack:3, dash,
          attack:3;
}
